title: "sharedstat: Diagnose and Correct Statistics Built from a Shared Component"
version: 0.1.2
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22946335
date-released: 2026-09-24
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22946335
